      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IXAtr">IX Atr</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">An ærest, þæt we ealle to Gode ælmihtigan georne gebugan ⁊ his bebodu healdan ⁊ unrihtes ealle geswican. (Expl.) [Wanley] An[d] uton ænne God lufian and weorðian and ænne Cristendom ealle heald[an] ⁊ ælcne hæþendom mid ealle aweorpan. Uton ænne cynehlaford holdliche … (desunt reliqua.) [Wanley]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the first place, we shall all zealously turn to God Almighty and keep his commandments and all cease from evil. And let us love and honour one God and all uphold one Christian faith and utterly renounce all heathen practices. Let us loyally [support] one royal lord....</ab>
      </div>
